Integration

Regularly test the complete application as a real user.

Test flows such as:

New user
→ Sign up
→ Create/enter game
→ Receive starting cash
→ Search for stock
→ View stock
→ Buy stock
→ Portfolio updates
→ Price changes
→ Portfolio value changes
→ Sell stock
→ Cash updates
→ Leaderboard updates

Also test:

Login
→ Dashboard
→ Logout
→ Login again
→ Data remains correct

Make sure the frontend and backend agree on:

Data formats

Types

Error responses

Authentication

Trade behavior

Portfolio calculations

If the frontend and backend disagree, fix the integration cleanly rather than adding fragile workarounds.

